{"shortDescription":"The Australian dollar edged above $0.72, moving toward a four-month high as increasingly hawkish signals from the Reserve Bank continued to reinforce expectations for another rate hike this month.Deputy Governor Andrew Hauser said late Tuesday that the central bank will debate the case for higher r…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["The Australian dollar edged above $0.72, moving toward a four-month high as increasingly hawkish signals from the Reserve Bank continued to reinforce expectations for another rate hike this month."]},{"type":"p","children":["Deputy Governor Andrew Hauser said late Tuesday that the central bank will debate the case for higher rates at its September meeting, citing persistently high inflation and upside risks."]},{"type":"p","children":["Assistant Governor Sarah Hunter also said the RBA has little tolerance for stronger inflation and may need to raise rates for a fourth time this year."]},{"type":"p","children":["The central bank has already increased its cash rate three times in 2026 as surging oil prices linked to the Gulf conflict pushed inflation higher."]},{"type":"p","children":["Markets are now pricing a 74% probability of a 25-basis-point hike at the September 29 meeting, up sharply from less than 10% a month ago, while a November move is fully priced in."]},{"type":"p","children":["Elsewhere, stronger trade data from China also supported the Chinese-proxy Aussie, with China being Australia’s largest trading partner."]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"Forex","args":[{"id":"category","value":"forex"}]},{"title":"Trading Economics","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"trading-economics"}]}],"id":"te_news:582211:0","title":"Aussie Marches Toward 4-Month High","published":1788918958,"urgency":2,"link":"https://tradingeconomics.com/australia/currency","permission":"preview","relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"FX:AUDUSD","currency-logoid":"country/US","base-currency-logoid":"country/AU",